IMAPStore gmail-remote
Host imap.gmail.com
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
User me@jeltef.nl
PassCmd "oama access me@jeltef.nl"

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/mail/
Inbox ~/mail/INBOX/
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Create Both
Expunge Both
Patterns "Postgres/Interesting" "Postgres"
SyncState *

Channel gmail-drafts
Far :gmail-remote:[Gmail]/Drafts
Near :gmail-local:Drafts
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
